    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Flames engulf you for the duration, shedding Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet. They grant you Immunity to Fire damage, and while they last, you have Advantage on spell attack rolls.</p><p>At the end of each of your turns, each creature of your choice in a 5-foot Emanation originating from you takes 3d8 Fire damage.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-o0eG6jTInQ3w8pPw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect gives the light and the Immunity; take the Advantage on your spell attack rolls by hand.</p></section>",
